   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Republic of Serbia Ministry for the Protection of Natural Resources and Environment (MPNRE) was established in May 2002.There is need for the MPNRE to develop into an efficient and effective government department with clear policies, strategies and legislation.The project should improve the management capacity within the MPNRE, through advisory and supporting activities.</narrative>
